comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-01T23:05:01.566Z","harness:codex","Delivery evidence: added the opt-in --token-accounting contract across CLI, structured errors, MCP tool calls, and public SDK exports. Receipts count exact UTF-8 bytes before the receipt, use ceil(bytes/4), attribute result_rows/envelope/diagnostics/hints exactly to the total, measure their own bounded overhead, and exclude only token_accounting. Disabled-path corpus assertions prove no receipt or output-byte cost when off; independent rerender assertions prove reported totals cannot drift. The final sandboxed suite passed 6,688 tests with 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines. Contract snapshots, typecheck, static quality, duplicate detection, secrets scan, docs links, and context-eval gates passed. Packed npm and Bun consumers resolved their executable inside unrelated install roots; success and not-found output both carried accounting, and direct @unbrained/pm-cli/sdk imports returned receipts."
